<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
 AMR ROS 2 TF/visualization model generated from robot_desciption.scad (2026-09-23).
 Original CAD: millimeters, +X forward, +Y left, +Z up, ground z=0.
 URDF: meters/radians. base_link is at chassis underside z=0.1135 m.
 All sensor/body joints are fixed; drive wheels have continuous joints.
 No map->odom or odom->base_footprint TF is defined by this model.
 Camera optical extrinsics and lidar scan-plane origin are uncalibrated placeholders.
 Caster housings simplified; real caster steering and wheel spins are not modeled.
-->
